OL,3,GNEWSAPolice find body in search for
OL,4,Amissing woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have found the body of a woman
OL,7,Fafter a three-day search.
OL,9,FJulie Foster, 63, was last been seen
OL,10,Fheading towards Shakespeare Street in
OL,11,FPadiham on Thursday, Lancashire Police
OL,12,Fsaid.
OL,14,FThe force said the body discovered in
OL,15,Fwoodland off Burnley Road in Padiham
OL,16,Fhas been confirmed to be Julie. Her
OL,17,Floved ones have been informed and are
OL,18,Fbeing supported, it added.
OL,20,FHer death is not being treated as
OL,21,Fsuspicious and police said a file would
OL,22,Fbe passed to the coroner.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
